          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.020:block:8",
          "start": 571
        },
        "quote": "(7) Accommodate the rights of individuals to free speech; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.020:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.020 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "246be0bb-87d3-5dc3-b361-548795eed5fd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 705,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.020:block:9",
          "start": 633
        },
        "quote": "(8) Preserve and promote the public health, safety, and general welfare.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.020:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.020 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "f9ad284a-1023-5bbe-b970-b436d1193133",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1304,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.020:block:10",
          "start": 706
        },
        "quote": "(c) This chapter regulates only the sign structure or copy design, and not the sign’s content. The type, size, dimensions, setbacks, and physical design of signs permitted by this chapter protect the City’s purpose as described in this chapter. The City developed the standards in this chapter upon completion of a public process in which the design and dimensional standards were tested in consideration of industry criteria, past experience in administering sign standards, and community input as to the appropriate characteristics of signs in the City’s various neighborhoods and business areas.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.020:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.020 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
